{
	quest.01209F6BE7124B04.quest_desc: [
		"Powah's Furnator burns anything a furnace would. Easy early power."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Furnator (Starter) and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.01209F6BE7124B04.title: "Burn Stuff"
	quest.0405A8F0D82D9834.quest_desc: [
		"Most machines in Nine Craft run on Forge Energy (FE). Any generator can power any machine, so start simple and upgrade as you go."
		""
		"§eHow power moves:§r a generator makes FE, cables carry it and machines use it. Batteries (energy cells) store it for later. This chapter takes you from burning coal to 64x generators."
		""
		"Collect some redstone to start. Nearly every power block needs it."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 16 x Redstone Dust and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.0405A8F0D82D9834.title: "Power 101"
